{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>וישב</b> — Rabbi Judah ben Balaam said: for it is a name for a nation. In my opinion: that he is a bastard from forbidden unions, they shall dwell alone, adjacent to Jerusalem. And the meaning: the lowly and despised of Israel, they alone shall dwell in the cities of Philistia, for they are not counted among the Chaldeans and the Philistines; their pride shall be cut off from them, for they are of the people of Israel."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:26.251686645Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}